31,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Good morning everyone! Did everyone sleep well?,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Minako,,I have information. Sakura is the werewolf.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"That was fast. Minako, are you the Seer?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"What?! Sakura? No way, she's just a kid!","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Misaki,,It's possible. The wolf could be anyone.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Eh?! Me?! Minako-san, that's a mean joke! I'm just a villager!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
